{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y把不少随音乐到时出现的细微变化压成了短词，部分段落右侧甚至留空，因此音乐与心理变化的逐拍对应明显不如X细。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"Y的左侧一直承担人物发生了什么、为什么会这样，右侧只补当下质感，扫屏时很容易先抓住故事骨架，再顺手接到感受，所以从离开、想念、动摇到重新站稳更像同一件事连续发展。X的高亮和到时出现确实能给出更细、更具体的音乐心理对应，但不少屏幕同时堆着多组相近感受，普通观众边听边扫时容易抓到很多漂亮细节，却较难迅速判断这一刻最重要的变化是什么。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "34a140ec-9ac0-40ed-ad68-563016d53fd8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T040932003472Z", "elapsed_seconds": 9.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:09:41.100056+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bbe986afc2dc8d5b8f0d995b9292c015a767fe77bae49ee36441b53528691e46", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}